  "introText": "Hey guys! I’m BUDDY! Today, we’ll work on two vowels that stay blurred long after fluency arrives. They are... …CAT and CAKE! The contrast survives in real minimal pairs: vanish\n\nIsolated, each word sounds acceptable. Side by side, the difference is obvious. That is why the pair, and not the single word, is the only useful exercise here.",
